    {
      "antd": "Switch",
      "category": "A",
      "eview": "Toggle",
      "importPath": "@nce/eview-react/Toggle",
      "shellComponent": false,
      "keyDiffs": "checked→toggled；onChange→onToggle(value)；data=[关,开]；taggledChildren（拼错）；Switch isControlToggled 二次确认；**disabled 保留不变**（Toggle 用 disabled 正确拼写，**不是 disable**——disable 只属于 SelectCard/FileUpload/PopUpMenu）",
      "ref": "components/Toggle.md",
      "files": [
        "src/components/header-bar/index.jsx",
        "src/views/asset-tree/index.jsx"
      ]
    },
    {
      "antd": "Menu",
      "category": "A",
      "eview": "Accordion",
      "importPath": "@nce/eview-react/Accordion",
      "shellComponent": false,
      "keyDiffs": "items→data（key/label→value/title）；selectedKeys 数组→selectedValue 单 string；onClick({key})→onClick(node)；inlineCollapsed→expanded/onExpand（⚠️ expanded={true}=收起，语义反转）；**统一用 Accordion，不手写**（单层平铺菜单用单层 data 无 children + enableExpand={false} + hideIcons + hideTitleBar，见 [Accordion.md](components/Accordion.md) §2/§10）；见 [Accordion.md](components/Accordion.md)",
      "ref": "components/Accordion.md",
      "files": [
        "src/components/sidebar/index.jsx"
      ]
    },
    {
      "antd": "Tree",
      "category": "A",
      "eview": "Tree",
      "importPath": "@nce/eview-react/Tree",
      "shellComponent": false,
      "keyDiffs": "treeData→data；节点字段 title→text、key→id（nodeKey=\"id\" 指定主键字段名，**不是** fieldNames）；checkable→enableCheckbox（**不要用 demo 里的 checkable**，不在 API 表）；三套受控状态分离：selectedKeys/onSelect、checkedKeys/onCheck、expandedKeys/onExpand，回调首参是新 keys 数组（**不是** antd 的 (checkedKeys, info)）；**enableMultiSelect 默认 true**，单选导航树必须显式 enableMultiSelect={false}（否则 Ctrl 多选会让联动取 keys[0] 错乱）；onExpand 必须接（只传 expandedKeys 不接回调用户点箭头展开不了）；loadData(itemData, callback) 异步加载子节点（isLeaf: false 显箭头）；connectLine 连线、height 开虚拟滚动、ref.findLevelNodes(value) 搜索定位；父子联动 disabelCheckAssociated（官方拼错）；导入 @nce/eview-react/Tree（非包壳）；见 [Tree.md](components/Tree.md)",
      "ref": "components/Tree.md",
      "files": [
        "src/views/asset-tree/index.jsx"
      ]
    }
  ],
